  "qemu": {
    "machine": "virt",
    "cpu": "cortex-a15",
    "smp": 1,
    "memoryMb": 512,
    "kernel": "nuttx.bin",
    "bootMode": "raw",
    "entryAddr": 6295776,
    "dataImg": "data.img",
    "extraArgs": "",
    "touchInput": true,
    "autoCommand": "mount -t vfat /dev/virtblk0 /data; vapp hap://app/com.vela.demo"
  },
  "ui": {
    "accentColor": "#FF6900",
    "watchfaceStyle": "digital"
  },
  "imageId": "vela-vapp-demo",
  "note": "v2.1.1 内置固件演示机（466x466 圆表形态，与 Watch S4 同规格屏幕）：APK 自带 nuttx.bin + data.img（含 com.vela.demo vapp 资源包），QuickJS 解析 rpk → VDOM → LVGL → virtio-gpu → VNC 渲染。固件零下载，点部署秒级就绪。引导方式为 raw bin @0x600000 + PC=0x6002e0。注意：真机 TCG 软件模拟引导较慢，点启动后画面页会显示实时引导进度，低端设备首次出画约 1-3 分钟，属正常现象。"
}
